flowchart TD
 INPUT[Location + category + idea] --> DATA[Market data service]
 DATA --> KIND{Provenance type}
 KIND -->|Synthetic/mock| MOCK[Template and generated values]
 KIND -->|External| PROVIDER[Configured provider results]
 MOCK --> SCORE[BizScore and category scoring]
 PROVIDER --> SCORE
 SCORE --> COMP[Competition and location analysis]
 COMP --> FORECAST[Forecast, risk and finance]
 FORECAST --> REPORT[Feasibility report builder]
 REPORT --> UI[Charts, cards and recommendations]
 UI --> SAVE[Optional Supabase persistence]
